abstract: >-
  Proposes a pass-bar for agent-evaluation task authorship and a construction
  that catches fake deltas: ranking AUROC invariance under mean-only shift,
  paired with a train-site shortcut that flips at evaluation and a frozen,
  verifier-recomputed control. Reference tasks and a scored fail rubric included.
